  "full_text": "Hey there, how's it going? I'm Lisa. Same old, same old. I'm Carlos. Are you the new engineer? Yes, I am. I work at the technology company next door. I'm 27 years old. That's cool. I'm 33. I work at the music studio. I'm a singer. No way. Are you good at singing? Yes, but I don't like dancing. What about you? I love to dance, but I'm not into singing. By the way, where do you live? I live in Mexico City. And you? I live in Tokyo. We'll catch you later, Carlos. See you, Lisa."
